# SHOWSTOPPER: three hearts; a hit costs one and leaves her safe for a
# moment; with none left a life goes. A pit takes a life at once, however
# many hearts. A lost life brings her back on the spot in a bubble she can
# float about (over pits too) and pop with A or B on firm ground; it pops
# by itself when its time runs out. Out of the bubble: three hearts, a
# moment's safety, and every card power gone.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat arena
wait 61
cheat pow 2 2
expect pow2 == 2
cheat bullet 0 168 2504 0 0
wait 2
expect hp == 2
expect hits == 1
expect inv > 0
# safe for a while: a second shot does nothing
cheat bullet 0 168 2504 0 0
wait 2
expect hp == 2
wait 95
cheat bullet 0 168 2504 0 0
wait 2
expect hp == 1
wait 95
cheat bullet 0 168 2504 0 0
wait 2
expect hp == 0
expect pstate == 3
wait 45
expect lives == 2
expect pstate == 4
expect pow2 == 0
# float the bubble, then pop it
wait 25
hold RIGHT 20
expect px == 188
press A
expect pstate == 0
expect hp == 3
expect inv > 100
# a pit: a life at once
cheat cam 180
cheat arena
cheat pos 104 264
wait 120
hold DOWN 30
expect pstate == 2
wait 32
expect lives == 1
expect falls == 1
expect pstate == 4
# over the pit the bubble won't pop; its time runs out and it pops on firm ground
press B
expect pstate == 4
wait 320
expect pstate == 0
expect lives == 1
